  "bodyHash": "N7i+IBZ73h4=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0bda6846-da8d-48f6-ac37-1252123e8e6d.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b2a4500a-aeb5-4660-9b15-4475155b619b.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用魔法鋼與詛咒鋼鍛造奇幻武器，成為真正的法師或聖騎士，手持傳說熔爐之刃。</p><p>在工作台上使用鑽石、紫水晶碎片和粗銅來獲得魔法鋼，可用於鍛造獨特而強大的武器。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_10ba6c93-cdaf-4c60-a892-7d360a523a5f.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:right\">在工作台上使用鑽石、石英和遠古殘骸碎片來獲得詛咒鋼，可用於鍛造獨特且更加強大的武器。</p><p><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_47b1d09f-1136-4281-9856-839e4f25045c.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">完全兼容 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better Combat</strong></a></span>，推薦使用以獲得更沉浸的體驗，同時強烈推薦 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a></span> 來查看合成配方！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6932b72-7f8b-41fa-b062-2fd2626d3ff8.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0b2e43e5-b60f-44e1-b003-379e2ce89f23.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327255/description_fc1333a6-aeaa-450c-ab28-5e3e7854a4ec.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">您可以在我的 Ko-fi 上支持我 ☕</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnenuartstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/nenuartstudio</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎在您的模組包中使用此模組！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">留下評論以支持此模組！</p>",
